{"title":"2025 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 3a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A parabola with equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/c/24cf2d8efcb8217f3274aa19d98fa94af2df837d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = ax^{2} + bx + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/35496101e151991fc3213a7472ade63fd75bdf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/35496101e151991fc3213a7472ade63fd75bdf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, and a line intersect at points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/9/c09faaec4a59cf56cd29a34745ee270bbde4ec6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(p, q)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/9/cd9981e45f63b931a97dbd54500a5c8dc133e420.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(r, s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" /> for some real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. In this case, the area enclosed by the parabola and the line, as shaded in the diagram, is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/6/1f6ceb4861bd521207331a016e71b160315fac8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(p - r)^{3}}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"67\" height=\"41\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/3/52368089575a94e9708c1123213d9e95ec4cbb12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p &gt; r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_3a&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_3a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the area enclosed by the parabola with equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/2/1f276b1a87a924a8e3e9bbb5529d7ade2ed49edf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x^{2} + 3x - 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" /> and the line with equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/d/e8d3f41e4ce3512f73fcda8ef2c9c236f7143a41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_3a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can first figure out where the parabola intersects the line, as that will allow us to find what <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are. Two equations intersect when the equations are equal to each other, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/10186d3fe58255eafd03833aa1889d47dcd6ef96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + 3x - 12 = 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/e/2be37e7ebf201bfe2e2603428829c7abe5a25657.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + x - 12 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b31b51deaa1a9e903d120a02141556c3e70e348.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> add up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/a/dcadf6b880a738849845ef4a0bb57403e9898359.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/2/4a26386870d8aac9343692d8e3adf0199576af1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + 4x - 3x - 12 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"177\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/d/80df2e323e3b15bd0b597eb6d87066be33e24b98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x + 4) - 3(x + 4) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/0/e7022c1aff534d7f8b683cb2208303721f611d12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 3)(x + 4) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We can then see that for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b193a0894d71a4e829f24468fb3ff365313ccc67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b4c3e97b90e7ed8f39e9634f062b3abc343052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" /> to be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> would have to be either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/d/72d85c6959aaabfff6e0104544ff25c1445f3f1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. We could have also used the quadratic formula to find this.\n</p><p>Next, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> represent these values but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/3/52368089575a94e9708c1123213d9e95ec4cbb12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p &gt; r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/e/5bee8bc4dabea7532e7359aa8ac83217db2f4dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/c/3bcf9a1238abfbd7d51139c9a0e59ac22535af4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />. Using the formula for the enclosed area given in the problem, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/3/b23e1bbdbc3168eee77d78171fdc08be89881c74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(3 - (-4))^{3}}{6} = \\frac{7^3}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"141\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/e/e4ec6f9019288d1ba723e980236995093d3b2511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\frac{343}{6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"64\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017050345\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 131/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1356/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6581/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.534      1 2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_3\n100.00%   34.534      1 -total\n 30.95%   10.687      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36321:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017050345 and revision id 281343. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}